    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: left; width: 0.25in; vertical-align: top"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9679;</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">build
    a strong and well-recognized brand;</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">
