    <td colspan="2" style="font-weight: bold; text-align: center">USD</td><td style="font-weight: bold">&#160;</td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <td style="text-align: justify">Shareholders&#8217; Equity:</td><td>&#160;</td>
