    <td style="width: 1%; font-size: 10pt; text-align: left">&#160;</td><td style="width: 6%; font-size: 10pt; text-align: right">(12,853,862</td><td style="width: 1%; font-size: 10pt; text-align: left">)</td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: White">
    <td style="font-size: 10pt; text-align: left">Net cash used in investing activities</td><td style="font-size: 10pt">&#160;</td>
