    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; white-space: nowrap; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9679;</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">create
    new classes of shares with preference to be determined by resolution of the board of directors to amend the memorandum and articles
