<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0"><b></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: center"><b>MEIWU TECHNOLOGY COMPANY LIMITED</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: center"><b>NOTES TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</b></p>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><b>4.
ACQUISITIONS (CONTINUED)</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">These
transactions were accounted for under the acquisition method of accounting in accordance with ASC 805, Business Combinations. The results
of the Yuanxing&#8217;s operations have been included in the Company&#8217;s consolidated financial statements since December 23, 2022.
The revenue and net loss of the Yuanxing from the acquisition date to December 31, 2022 was $<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionsProFormaRevenue_c20221212__20221231__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--YuanxingMember_zNWquF6x91Q8"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessAcquisitionsProFormaRevenue" contextRef="From2022-12-122022-12-31_custom_YuanxingMember" id="Fact000916" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">537,252</ix:nonFraction>
</span>and $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionsProFormaNetIncomeLoss_iN_c20221212__20221231__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--YuanxingMember_zngtAnCw4Bo6"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessAcquisitionsProFormaNetIncomeLoss" contextRef="From2022-12-122022-12-31_custom_YuanxingMember" id="Fact000917" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">169,034</ix:nonFraction>
</span>respectively.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

