    </span><span style="font-size: 10pt">as working capital for one year, with maturity date of </span><span class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_" id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDate_dd_c20210707__20210707__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--BankOfJiangsuMember_z0ZshcTZCr9j" style="font-size: 10pt"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2021-07-072021-07-07_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_BankOfJiangsuMember" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" id="Fact001099" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate">July
    7, 2022</ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="font-size: 10pt">. The loan bears a fixed interest rate of </span><span class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_" id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20210707__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--BankOfJiangsuMember_zhXDfV6giB4j" style="font-size: 10pt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2021-07-07_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_BankOfJiangsuMember" id="Fact001100" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">7.1775</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size: 10pt">%
