    </span><span style="font-size: 10pt">as working capital for one year, with maturity date of </span><span class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_" id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDate_c20220730__20220730__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--BankOfJiangsuMember_zs6KqwOHsaec" style="font-size: 10pt"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-07-302022-07-30_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_BankOfJiangsuMember" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" id="Fact001102" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate">July
    30, 2023</ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="font-size: 10pt">. The loan bears a fixed interest rate of </span><span class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_" id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20220730__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--BankOfJiangsuMember_zpjivdqwYxC4" style="font-size: 10pt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2022-07-30_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_BankOfJiangsuMember" id="Fact001103" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">7.134</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size: 10pt">%
    per annum. The maturity date of this loan is extended to </span><span class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_" id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDate_dd_c20231031__20231031__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ChinaConstructionBankMember_zBpOj0RR4prc" style="font-size: 10pt"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-10-312023-10-31_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaConstructionBankMember" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" id="Fact001104" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate">October
    31, 2023</ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="font-size: 10pt">.</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span style="font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span id="xdx_F03_zBQapv7ZkA49" style="font-size: 10pt">(2)</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F17_zCXK9AU8Rohg" style="font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001105" xml:lang="en-US">On
    September 16, 2021, Meiwu Shenzhen entered into a loan agreement with Shenzhen Qianhai Weizhong Bank to borrow $</ix:footnote></span><span class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_" id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--LongTermDebtNoncurrent_iI_c20210916__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ShenzhenQianhaiWeizhongBankMember_z1COOEliXrag" style="font-size: 10pt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LongTermDebtNoncurrent" contextRef="AsOf2021-09-16_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ShenzhenQianhaiWeizhongBankMember" id="Fact001106" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">414,072</ix:nonFraction>
    </span><span style="font-size: 10pt">as working capital for two years, with maturity date of </span><span class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_" id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDate_c20210916__20210916__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ShenzhenQianhaiWeizhongBankMember_zbz86jovOP93" style="font-size: 10pt"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2021-09-162021-09-16_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ShenzhenQianhaiWeizhongBankMember" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" id="Fact001107" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate">September
    16, 2023</ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="font-size: 10pt">. The loan bears a fixed interest rate of </span><span class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_" id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20210916__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ShenzhenQianhaiWeizhongBankMember_zOqAn28ua8Bc" style="font-size: 10pt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2021-09-16_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ShenzhenQianhaiWeizhongBankMember" id="Fact001108" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">8.46</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size: 10pt">%
    per annum. The loan is guaranteed by Mr. Changbin Xia, for whom the chief executive officer of Meiwu Shenzhen. The maturity date
    of this loan is extended to </span><span class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_" id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDate_dd_c20240316__20240316__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ShenzhenQianhaiWeizhongBankMember_zdKWm6UbKkG4" style="font-size: 10pt"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-03-162024-03-16_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ShenzhenQianhaiWeizhongBankMember" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" id="Fact001109" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate">March
    16, 2024</ix:nonNumeric></span></td></tr>
