    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span id="xdx_F04_zLojjRPVCJyg" style="font-size: 10pt">(3)</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F19_zPywovd4tLn8" style="font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001110" xml:lang="en-US">On
    January 6, 2022, Meiwu Shenzhen entered into a loan agreement with China Construction Bank to borrow $</ix:footnote></span><span class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_" id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--ShortTermBorrowings_iI_c20220106__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ChinaConstructionBankMember_z5L1aRfPnkig" style="font-size: 10pt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShortTermBorrowings" contextRef="AsOf2022-01-06_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaConstructionBankMember" id="Fact001111" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">217,045</ix:nonFraction>
    </span><span style="font-size: 10pt">as working capital for one year, with maturity date of </span><span class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_" id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDate_dd_c20220106__20220106__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ChinaConstructionBankMember_zs68AeVpJ5hg" style="font-size: 10pt"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-01-062022-01-06_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaConstructionBankMember" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" id="Fact001112" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate">January
    6, 2023</ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="font-size: 10pt">. The loan bears a fixed interest rate of </span><span class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_" id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20220106__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ChinaConstructionBankMember_zLBrpFC6jUp7" style="font-size: 10pt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2022-01-06_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaConstructionBankMember" id="Fact001113" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4.0525</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size: 10pt">%
    per annum. And the maturity date of this loan is extended to April 16, 2023.On October 14, 2022, Meiwu Shenzhen entered into a loan
    agreement with China Construction Bank to borrow $</span><span class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_" id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ShortTermBorrowings_iI_c20221014__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ChinaConstructionBankMember_z6Y8kIoMRjVk" style="font-size: 10pt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShortTermBorrowings" contextRef="AsOf2022-10-14_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaConstructionBankMember" id="Fact001114" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">71,768</ix:nonFraction>
    </span><span style="font-size: 10pt">as working capital for one year, with maturity date of </span><span class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_" id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDate_dd_c20221014__20221014__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ChinaConstructionBankMember_zxPhis3fdFIa" style="font-size: 10pt"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-10-142022-10-14_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaConstructionBankMember" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" id="Fact001115" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate">October
    14, 2023</ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="font-size: 10pt">. The loan bears a fixed interest rate of </span><span class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_" id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20221014__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ChinaConstructionBankMember_zN58TyGAv0z6" style="font-size: 10pt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2022-10-14_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaConstructionBankMember" id="Fact001116" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">3.90</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size: 10pt">%
    per annum. </span></td></tr>
  </table>
</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8AC_z5DhKNEAJMz2" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">Due
to (1), (2) and (3) breach of the covenant, the banks are contractually entitled to request for immediate repayment of the outstanding
loans amount of $408,685. The outstanding balance are presented as a current liabilities as of June 30, 2024.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">As of
the date when these consolidated financial statements were approved by the management, management is in the process of renegotiating
the terms of the loans arrangement with the banks and expects that a revised loan agreement will be in place after the financial year
end.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-01-01to2024-06-30" escape="true" id="Fact001118" name="us-gaap:AccountsPayableAndAccruedLiabilitiesDisclosureTextBlock"><p id="xdx_808_eus-gaap--AccountsPayableAndAccruedLiabilitiesDisclosureTextBlock_zlX4WlBWNMai" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><b>10.
