<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">The
Company does not have any variable lease costs. Cash payment made under the lease agreements is $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--OperatingLeasePayments_c20240101__20240630__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__us-gaap--LeaseAgreementsMember_z1EPfyFXQRY7"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLeasePayments" contextRef="From2024-01-012024-06-30_us-gaap_LeaseAgreementsMember" id="Fact001146" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">60,262</ix:nonFraction>
</span>and $<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--OperatingLeasePayments_c20230101__20230630__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__us-gaap--LeaseAgreementsMember_zScyNQey0Yi6"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLeasePayments" contextRef="From2023-01-012023-06-30_us-gaap_LeaseAgreementsMember" id="Fact001147" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">54,967</ix:nonFraction>
</span>for the six months ended June 30, 2024 and 2023, respectively. The weighted-average remaining lease term is <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageRemainingLeaseTerm1_iI_dtY_c20240630_zLS2rgVovnYg"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2024-06-30" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact001148" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageRemainingLeaseTerm1">0.67</ix:nonNumeric>
</span>and <span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageRemainingLeaseTerm1_iI_dtY_c20231231_zCx2gQEKbOpl"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2023-12-31" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact001149" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageRemainingLeaseTerm1">1.16</ix:nonNumeric></span>
years as of June 30, 2024 and December 31, 2023. Interest expense was $<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--InterestExpense_c20240101__20240630__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__us-gaap--LeaseAgreementsMember_zMkgG12HdIV"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InterestExpense" contextRef="From2024-01-012024-06-30_us-gaap_LeaseAgreementsMember" id="Fact001150" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">2,653</ix:nonFraction>
</span>and $<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--InterestExpense_c20230101__20230630__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__us-gaap--LeaseAgreementsMember_zSTXfGi5wbN9"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InterestExpense" contextRef="From2023-01-012023-06-30_us-gaap_LeaseAgreementsMember" id="Fact001151" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">5,390</ix:nonFraction></span>
for the six months ended June 30,2024 and 2023 respectively.</p>

