<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">Amortization
expense was recognized as lease expense in general and administrative expense. Non-cash portion of amortization expense was $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--AdjustmentForAmortization_c20240101__20240630_z7atbs61J1gb"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AdjustmentForAmortization" contextRef="From2024-01-01to2024-06-30" id="Fact001172" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">42,056</ix:nonFraction>
