<span id="xdx_825_zV2eHeviwf43">COMMITMENTS</span></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><b><i>Non-cancellable
operating leases</i></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-01-01to2024-06-30" escape="true" id="Fact001387" name="srt:ContractualObligationFiscalYearMaturityScheduleTableTextBlock"><p id="xdx_89D_esrt--ContractualObligationFiscalYearMaturityScheduleTableTextBlock_zIivmHAH1tsc" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">The
following table sets forth our contractual obligations as of June 30, 2024.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

