<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">As
of December 31, 2023 and 2022, the Company has accounts receivable, net of $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--AccountsReceivableNetCurrent_iI_c20231231_z0BWZ9mmvkt7" title="Accounts receivable"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AccountsReceivableNetCurrent" contextRef="AsOf2023-12-31" id="Fact002719" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">2,874,494</ix:nonFraction></span>&#160;&#160; and $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--AccountsReceivableNetCurrent_iI_c20221231_z4DpHThT4291" title="Accounts receivable"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AccountsReceivableNetCurrent" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31" id="Fact002721" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">4,043,473</ix:nonFraction></span>. The aging of account
receivables were all less than 30 days. The allowance for doubtful accounts was $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--AllowanceForDoubtfulAccountsReceivableCurrent_iI_c20231231_zfBIH75eonx8" title="Allowance for doubtful accounts"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AllowanceForDoubtfulAccountsReceivableCurrent" contextRef="AsOf2023-12-31" id="Fact002723" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">407,480</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--AllowanceForDoubtfulAccountsReceivableCurrent_iI_c20221231_zn1bsm560GV3" title="Allowance for doubtful accounts"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AllowanceForDoubtfulAccountsReceivableCurrent" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31" id="Fact002725" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">400,262</ix:nonFraction></span> as of December 31, 2023 and 2022.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

