    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F1E_z7A5a9G1lSK6" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote002842" xml:lang="en-US">On
    July 7, 2021, Meiwu Shenzhen entered into a loan agreement with Bank of Jiangsu to borrow $<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--ShortTermBorrowings_iI_c20210707__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--BankOfJiangsuMember_zoy2fyvZhn17" title="Short-term bank loans" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShortTermBorrowings" contextRef="AsOf2021-07-07_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_BankOfJiangsuMember" id="Fact002844" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">47,054</ix:nonFraction></span> as working capital for one year,
    with maturity date of <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDate_dd_c20210707__20210707__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--BankOfJiangsuMember_zPd1gmaWeVG9" title="Debt maturity date" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2021-07-072021-07-07_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_BankOfJiangsuMember" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" id="Fact002846" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate">July 7, 2022</ix:nonNumeric></span>. The loan bears a fixed interest rate of <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20210707__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--BankOfJiangsuMember_zkuUtmoD0uZ3" title="Interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2021-07-07_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_BankOfJiangsuMember" id="Fact002848" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">7.1775</ix:nonFraction></span>% per annum. On July 30, 2022, Meiwu Shenzhen entered
    into a loan agreement with Bank of Jiangsu to borrow $<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--ShortTermBorrowings_iI_c20220730__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--BankOfJiangsuMember_zjHvIyGe8jaf" title="Short-term bank loans" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShortTermBorrowings" contextRef="AsOf2022-07-30_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_BankOfJiangsuMember" id="Fact002850" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">43,496</ix:nonFraction></span> as working capital for one year, with maturity date of <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDate_dd_c20220730__20220730__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--BankOfJiangsuMember_ztCQf3tb12ul" title="Debt maturity date" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-07-302022-07-30_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_BankOfJiangsuMember" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" id="Fact002852" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate">July 30, 2023</ix:nonNumeric></span>.
    The loan bears a fixed interest rate of <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20220730__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--BankOfJiangsuMember_zVpvxaBvST4c" title="Interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2022-07-30_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_BankOfJiangsuMember" id="Fact002854" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">7.134</ix:nonFraction></span>% per annum. The maturity date of this loan is extended to <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDate_dd_c20231031__20231031__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ChinaConstructionBankMember_zU70nUPc3PJh" title="Long-term bank loan" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-10-312023-10-31_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaConstructionBankMember" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" id="Fact002856" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate">October 31, 2023</ix:nonNumeric></span>.</ix:footnote></span></td></tr>
