    September 16, 2021, Meiwu Shenzhen entered into a loan agreement with Shenzhen Qianhai Weizhong Bank to borrow $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--LongTermDebtNoncurrent_iI_c20210916__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ShenzhenQianhaiWeizhongBankMember_zuc7N9xmlnF3" title="Long-term bank loan" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LongTermDebtNoncurrent" contextRef="AsOf2021-09-16_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ShenzhenQianhaiWeizhongBankMember" id="Fact002859" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">414,072</ix:nonFraction></span>
    as working capital for two years, with maturity date of <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDate_dd_c20210916__20210916__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ShenzhenQianhaiWeizhongBankMember_zZV1Crioldzd" title="Debt maturity date" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2021-09-162021-09-16_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ShenzhenQianhaiWeizhongBankMember" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" id="Fact002861" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate">September
    16, 2023</ix:nonNumeric></span>. The loan bears a fixed interest rate of <span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20210916__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ShenzhenQianhaiWeizhongBankMember_zFJeGv6pQbL8" title="Interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2021-09-16_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ShenzhenQianhaiWeizhongBankMember" id="Fact002863" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">8.46</ix:nonFraction></span>%
    per annum. The loan is guaranteed by Mr. Changbin Xia, for whom the chief executive officer of Meiwu Shenzhen. The maturity date of
    this loan is extended to <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDate_dd_c20240316__20240316__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ShenzhenQianhaiWeizhongBankMember_zuoAUoGHUxFl" title="Debt maturity date" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-03-162024-03-16_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ShenzhenQianhaiWeizhongBankMember" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" id="Fact002865" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate">March 16, 2024</ix:nonNumeric></span></ix:footnote></span></td></tr>
