    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F10_zlSsmgg29uH" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote002866" xml:lang="en-US">On
    January 6, 2022, Meiwu Shenzhen entered into a loan agreement with China Construction Bank to borrow $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--ShortTermBorrowings_iI_c20220106__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ChinaConstructionBankMember_z0xPRegz4f3l" title="Short-term bank loans" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShortTermBorrowings" contextRef="AsOf2022-01-06_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaConstructionBankMember" id="Fact002868" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">217,045</ix:nonFraction></span> as working capital
