    Bank to borrow $<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--ShortTermBorrowings_iI_c20221014__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ChinaConstructionBankMember_zeM6KZkIHLyb" title="Short-term bank loans" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShortTermBorrowings" contextRef="AsOf2022-10-14_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaConstructionBankMember" id="Fact002874" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">71,768</ix:nonFraction></span> as working capital for one year, with maturity date of <span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDate_dd_c20221014__20221014__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ChinaConstructionBankMember_zdlpOGgQr1A7" title="Long-term bank loan" class="Debt maturity date"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-10-142022-10-14_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaConstructionBankMember" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" id="Fact002876" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate">October 14, 2023</ix:nonNumeric></span>. The loan bears a fixed interest rate
