assets, net consisted of the following:</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><span id="xdx_8B2_zmb5kug6hM0f" style="display: none; font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">SCHEDULE
OF RIGHTS-TO-USE LEASE ASSETS</span></span></p>

