</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8AF_z5FwDcE08Shc" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Company does not have any variable lease costs. Cash payment made under the lease agreements is $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--OperatingLeasePayments_c20230101__20231231__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__us-gaap--LeaseAgreementsMember_zh5xSOJRYOn5" title="Cash payment"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLeasePayments" contextRef="From2023-01-012023-12-31_us-gaap_LeaseAgreementsMember" id="Fact002914" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">113,981</ix:nonFraction></span>, $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--OperatingLeasePayments_c20220101__20221231__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__us-gaap--LeaseAgreementsMember_z9hqBqID58dh" title="Cash payment"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLeasePayments" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_us-gaap_LeaseAgreementsMember" id="Fact002916" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">80,045</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--OperatingLeasePayments_c20210101__20211231__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__us-gaap--LeaseAgreementsMember_zyCyOGDa6Czh" title="Cash payment"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLeasePayments" contextRef="From2021-01-012021-12-31_us-gaap_LeaseAgreementsMember" id="Fact002918" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">329,952</ix:nonFraction></span> for the
years ended December 31, 2023, 2022 and 2020, respectively. The weighted-average remaining lease term is <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageRemainingLeaseTerm1_iI_dtY_c20231231_z82mlYhsEjs5" title="Weighted average remaining lease term"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2023-12-31" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact002920" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageRemainingLeaseTerm1">1.16</ix:nonNumeric></span> and <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageRemainingLeaseTerm1_iI_dtY_c20221231_zFUrR7gJxZsc" title="Weighted average remaining lease term"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact002922" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageRemainingLeaseTerm1">2.17</ix:nonNumeric></span> years as of December
31, 2023 and 2022. Interest expense was $<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--InterestExpense_c20230101__20231231__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__us-gaap--LeaseAgreementsMember_z2yednnrspBe" title="Interest expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InterestExpense" contextRef="From2023-01-012023-12-31_us-gaap_LeaseAgreementsMember" id="Fact002924" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">9,303</ix:nonFraction></span>, $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--InterestExpense_c20220101__20221231__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__us-gaap--LeaseAgreementsMember_zqjHLq5ZMptj" title="Interest expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InterestExpense" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_us-gaap_LeaseAgreementsMember" id="Fact002926" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">9,631</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--InterestExpense_c20210101__20211231__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__us-gaap--LeaseAgreementsMember_z72qGSX14DJ3" title="Interest expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InterestExpense" contextRef="From2021-01-012021-12-31_us-gaap_LeaseAgreementsMember" id="Fact002928" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">22,320</ix:nonFraction></span> for the years ended December 31,2023,2022 and 2021 respectively.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

