</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8AD_zBTWbtwf6NUc" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
January 6, 2022, the Company entered into a securities purchase agreement&#160;with <span style="background-color: white">five &#8220;accredited
investors&#8221; (the &#8220;<b>Purchasers</b>&#8221;)</span>, pursuant to which the Company <span style="background-color: white">agreed
to sell to each of such Purchasers an unsecured convertible note with an original principal amount of $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_c20220106__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--FiveAccreditedInvestorsMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--UnsecuredConvertibleNoteMember_zA8E2UzysJBb" title="Principal amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2022-01-06_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember_custom_FiveAccreditedInvestorsMember_custom_UnsecuredConvertibleNoteMember" id="Fact003173" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">1,100,000</ix:nonFraction>
</span></span></span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: white">(the &#8220;<b>Note</b>&#8221;).</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: white">Each
of the Notes bears interest at a rate of <span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20220106__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--FiveAccreditedInvestorsMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--UnsecuredConvertibleNoteMember_zu7S52haAsE2" title="Interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2022-01-06_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember_custom_FiveAccreditedInvestorsMember_custom_UnsecuredConvertibleNoteMember" id="Fact003175" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">10</ix:nonFraction></span></span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: white">%
per annum compounding daily. Each of the Note includes an original issue discount of $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscount_iI_pp2d_c20220106__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--FiveAccreditedInvestorsMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--UnsecuredConvertibleNoteMember_zsNs2lxYnfYc" title="Debt discount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscount" contextRef="AsOf2022-01-06_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember_custom_FiveAccreditedInvestorsMember_custom_UnsecuredConvertibleNoteMember" id="Fact003177" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="2" unitRef="USD">100,000.00</ix:nonFraction>
</span></span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: white">along with $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFeeAmount_iI_pp2d_c20220106__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--FiveAccreditedInvestorsMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--UnsecuredConvertibleNoteMember_zU6mosQM0tUa" title="Purchaser's  fees"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFeeAmount" contextRef="AsOf2022-01-06_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember_custom_FiveAccreditedInvestorsMember_custom_UnsecuredConvertibleNoteMember" id="Fact003179" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="2" unitRef="USD">4,000.00</ix:nonFraction>
</span></span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: white">for Purchasers&#8217;
fees, costs and other transaction expenses incurred in connection with the purchase and sale of the Notes. Each of the Purchasers can
convert his or her Note at any time after the six-month anniversary of the issuance date at a conversion price of the lower of (i) $<span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1_iI_c20220106__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--FiveAccreditedInvestorsMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--UnsecuredConvertibleNoteMember_z7xYwA6Ok6Q5" title="Debt Instrument conversion price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1" contextRef="AsOf2022-01-06_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember_custom_FiveAccreditedInvestorsMember_custom_UnsecuredConvertibleNoteMember" id="Fact003181" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.50</ix:nonFraction>
</span></span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: white">or (ii) <span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentConvertibleThresholdPercentageOfStockPriceTrigger_pid_dp_c20220105__20220106__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--FiveAccreditedInvestorsMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--UnsecuredConvertibleNoteMember_zezmlUVGhkYk" title="Percentage of the lowest daily volume-weighted average price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleThresholdPercentageOfStockPriceTrigger" contextRef="From2022-01-052022-01-06_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember_custom_FiveAccreditedInvestorsMember_custom_UnsecuredConvertibleNoteMember" id="Fact003183" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">80</ix:nonFraction></span></span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: white">%
of the lowest daily volume-weighted average price in the 20 trading days prior to the date on which the conversion price is measured
(the &#8220;<b>Market Price</b>&#8221;).&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>


<ix:exclude><!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 233; Value: 1 -->
